cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Gluco, please cite this software. For reproducibility, include
  the exact commit or a reviewed archived release when one is available.
type: software
title: 'Gluco: wearable signals and daily metabolic context'
authors:
  - name: Gluco contributors
    website: https://github.com/RudrakshNanavaty/gluco/graphs/contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/RudrakshNanavaty/gluco
url: https://github.com/RudrakshNanavaty/gluco
license: AGPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  Gluco is a research prototype combining wearable-data analytics,
  experimental metabolic-pattern scoring, a role-aware dashboard, and
  grounded contextual explanations. It is not a medical device, glucose
  measurement, diagnosis, or calibrated disease-risk estimate.
keywords:
  - research software
  - wearable data
  - data engineering
  - reproducible evaluation
